   "id": "sukun",
   "afterGroup": 3,
   "title": "Sukun: no vowel",
   "intro": [
    "A small circle above a letter is sukun. It means the letter has no vowel, so it joins the sound before it.",
    "That lets a syllable end in a consonant: bar, dars, bard."
   ],
   "reminder": "A small circle above a letter (sukun) means no vowel: the letter closes the syllable.",
