  {
   "id": "long_vowels",
   "afterGroup": 8,
   "title": "Long vowels and glides",
   "intro": [
    "Waw after a damma makes a long ū. Ya after a kasra makes a long ī. Alif after a fatha makes a long ā.",
    "Waw or ya with a sukun after a fatha makes a glide: aw as in yawm, ay as in bayt."
   ],
   "reminder": "Long vowels: ā, ū, ī take two beats. A sukun on waw or ya after fatha makes aw or ay.",
